1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Meet a very curious eleven-year-old. His mind is always discovering something new.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:25,000
He loves facts—amazing facts, unusual facts, and little details other people might miss.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:38,000
One of his happiest places is outside with his chickens. He enjoys caring for them.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:51,000
And then there is Dante, his Boxer and loyal companion.

5
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Making connections with other kids can sometimes be hard. He wants to share what he loves and feel included.

6
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Autism is one part of who he is. It does not tell his whole story.

7
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Friendship does not mean liking all the same things. It means making room for each other.

8
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:55,000
He deserves to be understood, included, and celebrated just as he is.
